Z||000000||Loki||04-20-2001||04:42 PM||||Im going to be repainting my gauge needles and was wondering.....if the needle is pilled off does the pin they mount on move? or can i just pull off and put back in same place and they read the same?<BR><P>------------------<BR>Loki<BR>ICQ# 16477998<BR>www.cox-internet.com/fiero  !!!UPDATED!!!||||reg||1
