Z||000002||Loki||04-20-2001||04:58 PM||||Sweet...For some odd reason I though that the speedo and tach move since the little pegs are there......<BR><P>------------------<BR>Loki<BR>ICQ# 16477998<BR>www.cox-internet.com/fiero  !!!UPDATED!!!||||reg||1
Z||000003||Pontiaddict||04-20-2001||05:27 PM||||With the key turned to the ON position the speedometer Oil pressure, (if it still works)and tach go to zero, just write down where the fuel and temp are and hope the temperature is the same when you replace the needle.||||reg||1
